size 40x5
cursor 19,3 block visible steady
colors fg #f6f1e9 bg #0a0e11 cursor #fc4926
row 0 |bold italic strike|
  0-3 bold
  5-10 italic
  12-17 strikethrough
row 1 |one two curly dots dash|
  0-2 underline single
  4-6 underline double
  8-12 underline curly
  14-17 underline dotted
  19-22 underline dashed
row 2 |inverse dim hidden|
  0-6 fg #0a0e11 bg #f6f1e9 inverse
  8-10 fg #8c8b88 dim
  12-17 invisible
row 3 |dimred invgreen all|
  0-5 fg #804a45 dim
  7-14 fg #0a0e11 bg #86b89a inverse
  16-18 bold italic underline single
input ctrl-c 03
input paste needs confirmation
input focus-lost -
